  (text "5V MUX U8: POWERBOARD > USB AUTO"
    (at 241.3 77.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b59ef481-ab26-4e00-8b29-d67e4dc2c5bb")
  )
  (text "3V3 MUX U9: POWERBOARD > USB LDO AUTO"
    (at 241.3 148.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c12ac4a1-72c7-4f18-9ab9-e2e56ee46c5b")
  )
  (text "J15 JST PH 7P: 1 RX (PB->MCU), 2 TX (MCU->PB), 3 GND, 4 +3V3, 5 GND, 6 +5V, 7 GND.\nR33/R34 1k limit current if TX/RX meet a driven line; not power-off isolation.\nQ1 reverse-polarity FET on 5V only; no 3V3 reverse-polarity FET."
    (at 19.05 68.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cdbc79e4-02d7-42ea-812e-cbf250e4521d")
  )
  (text "USB INPUT: C30 + C31 + C35 = 9.1uF on VBUS (USB limit 10uF).\nPTC rating is not USB-current permission. USB 3V3 comes from U7 LDO via U9.\nSources: TPS2116 7.3.2; MF-MSMF / 1812L; AP7361C."
    (at 110.49 232.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9d492a57-2610-4280-9b27-164f45a31bbe")
  )
  (text "POWER LAYOUT: short TVS return paths; input/output caps close to U8/U9.\nSize copper from the actual load and temperature (TPS2116 section 10; AP7361C thermal data)."
    (at 240.03 68.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "778113ac-7994-4769-a9cf-1dfc5f14f385")
  )
